<title>USA: Four Seasons Hotels stake cut by agency.</title>
<headline>Four Seasons Hotels stake cut by agency.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de Depot et Placement du Quebec said Monday it cut its stake in Four Seasons Hotels Inc to 7.58 percent, or 2,201,559 Subordinate Class A shares.</p>
<p>Caisse de Depot said it sold 292,300 shares between July 18 and August 1.</p>
<p>The agency said it reduced its stake for investment purposes.</p>
